{"id":"titles","title":"Titles","category":"interface","icon":"minecraft:name_tag","summary":"Earnable titles, small icon-and-text tags you wear before your name in chat and the tab list: all 32, how to earn each, and how to pick one.","blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"A "},{"x":"title","b":true},{"x":" is a small tag, an icon and a few letters in a colour, that shows before your name in chat and next to it in the Tab list: "},{"x":"[* Deep Miner] Name: hello","c":true},{"x":". You earn titles by doing things in the game, from reaching a skill level to defeating the Ender Wyrm. Once earned a title is yours for good. You wear one at a time."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Earning titles","anchor":"earning-titles"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Titles unlock by themselves. The game checks your progress every couple of seconds, so a title you already qualify for is awarded the first time you log in after the update: nothing you did earlier is lost. When you earn one you hear a chime and get a "},{"x":"TITLE UNLOCKED","c":true},{"x":" message in chat with a "},{"x":"[Equip]","b":true},{"x":" button. Your very first title is worn automatically."}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"A title's colour shows how hard it is: grey is common, green uncommon, blue rare, purple epic, gold legendary and pink mythic. A few have their own colour."}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Two titles are "},{"x":"hidden","b":true},{"x":": they show as "},{"x":"???","c":true},{"x":" on the Titles page until you earn them."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Choosing your title","anchor":"choosing-your-title"},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"K menu, Titles page.","b":true},{"x":" Every title is listed. Click an earned one to wear it, click the one you are wearing to take it off, or use "},{"x":"Take off title","b":true},{"x":". The tabs filter All, Earned and Locked. Locked titles are dimmed and say how to earn them, with a progress bar where the goal is a number (for example "},{"x":"4 / 25","c":true},{"x":"). Hover a row for the full text."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Commands.","b":true},{"x":" "},{"x":"/title","c":true},{"x":" lists your earned titles with an "},{"x":"[Equip]","b":true},{"x":" button, "},{"x":"/title locked","c":true},{"x":" lists the rest, "},{"x":"/title set <id>","c":true},{"x":" wears one (press Tab to complete the id, or click the button) and "},{"x":"/title clear","c":true},{"x":" takes it off."}]}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Where it shows","anchor":"where-it-shows"},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"Chat:","b":true},{"x":" between the level badge and your name, as a small pill: "},{"x":"(* 42) [* Deep Miner] Name","c":true},{"x":". Your name stays white."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Tab list:","b":true},{"x":" a pill after your name, in the title's colour. A long title is cut with \"...\"."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Name card:","b":true},{"x":" hover a name in chat to see the title on the card."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"An administrator can also give a player a "},{"x":"staff title","b":true},{"x":" with "},{"x":"/chat title","c":true},{"x":" (see "},{"x":"Chat","link":"chat"},{"x":"). A staff title "},{"x":"replaces","b":true},{"x":" the earned one while it is set, and the earned titles stay saved underneath."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"All titles","anchor":"all-titles"},{"t":"h3","text":"Skills","anchor":"skills"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Title"}],[{"x":"Icon"}],[{"x":"Rarity"}],[{"x":"How to earn it"}],[{"x":"Id"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Deep Miner","b":true}],[{"x":"pickaxe"}],[{"x":"Rare"}],[{"x":"Reach Mining level 25."}],[{"x":"deep_miner","c":true}]],[[{"x":"Green Thumb","b":true}],[{"x":"hoe"}],[{"x":"Rare"}],[{"x":"Reach Farming level 25."}],[{"x":"green_thumb","c":true}]],[[{"x":"Lumberjack","b":true}],[{"x":"axe"}],[{"x":"Rare"}],[{"x":"Reach Foraging level 25."}],[{"x":"lumberjack","c":true}]],[[{"x":"Angler","b":true}],[{"x":"fishing rod"}],[{"x":"Rare"}],[{"x":"Reach Fishing level 25."}],[{"x":"angler","c":true}]],[[{"x":"Warrior","b":true}],[{"x":"sword"}],[{"x":"Rare"}],[{"x":"Reach Combat level 25."}],[{"x":"warrior","c":true}